<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 "><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"XSTO Warranty Information","description":"Manufacturer warranty terms for XSTO powered wheelchairs in the UK."}</script><header class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Warranty"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">Warranty</span></li></ol></nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Warranty</h1><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted-foreground">All XSTO wheelchairs include manufacturer warranty cover managed in the UK by Bentech Medical Ltd.</p></header><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]"><nav aria-label="Table of contents" class="hidden lg:block"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">On this page</p><ul class="sticky top-24 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#overview">Warranty overview</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#frame">5-year frame warranty</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#electrical">1-year electrical &amp; mechanical warranty</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#battery">1-year battery warranty</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#claims">Making a claim</a></li></ul></nav><div class="min-w-0 space-y-10"><section id="overview"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Warranty overview</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>All XSTO powered wheelchairs sold in the UK through Bentech Medical Ltd include the manufacturer warranty below. Bentech Medical Ltd, as the official UK distributor, manages warranty registration and claims on your behalf.</p></div></section><section id="frame"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">5-year frame warranty</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>The main frame and base seat structure are covered for five years from the date of purchase against defects in materials and workmanship under normal domestic use.</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5"><li>Covers structural frame components and base seat assembly</li><li>Does not cover damage from misuse, accidents or unauthorised modifications</li><li>Proof of purchase required for all claims</li></ul></div></section><section id="electrical"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">1-year electrical &amp; mechanical warranty</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>Electrical and mechanical components — including motors, controllers, joysticks, sensors and wiring — are covered for one year from purchase.</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5"><li>Covers manufacturing defects under normal use</li><li>Excludes wear items such as tyres unless defective on arrival</li><li>Repairs or replacements at Bentech Medical Ltd discretion</li></ul></div></section><section id="battery"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">1-year battery warranty</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>The supplied battery is covered for one year against manufacturing defects. Battery capacity naturally reduces over time and is not covered beyond the stated warranty period.</p></div></section><section id="claims"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Making a claim</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>Contact sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849 with your order number, serial number and a description of the issue. Photos or video help us assess claims quickly. Do not attempt repairs that may void your warranty.</p></div></section></div></div><section aria-labelledby="warranty-register-heading" class="mt-12"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="warranty-register-heading">Register your warranty</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Register your product to speed up future warranty claims. Returns policy: <a href="/pages/returns" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-dark">view our returns page</a>.</p><div class="mt-6 max-w-xl">{% form 'contact', class: 'space-y-4', id: 'mr-form-warranty-registration' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[Enquiry type]" value="Warranty registration">{%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}<p class="rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-sm border-border bg-secondary/40 text-foreground" role="status">Thank you. Your warranty registration has been received.</p>{%- endif -%}{%- if form.errors -%}<div class="rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-sm border-destructive/40 text-destructive" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{%- endif -%}<label class="block text-sm" for="name"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Full name</span><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm" id="name" required="" type="text" name="contact[name]"/></label><label class="block text-sm" for="email"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Email</span><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm" id="email" required="" type="email" name="contact[email]"/></label><label class="block text-sm" for="orderRef"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Order reference</span><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm" id="orderRef" required="" type="text" name="contact[Order reference]"/></label><label class="block text-sm" for="serial"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Serial number</span><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm" id="serial" required="" type="text" name="contact[Serial number]"/></label><label class="block text-sm" for="purchaseDate"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Purchase date</span><input class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm" id="purchaseDate" required="" type="date" name="contact[Purchase date]"/></label><button class="btn-accent min-h-11 w-full sm:w-auto sm:min-w-[11rem] disabled:opacity-60" type="submit">Register warranty</button>{% endform %}</div></section></div>
